"DATA","13738980","25.50","","7.3","Depth to water at end of shift 9.2m, level rose to 8.6m overnight. Depth to water at end of shift 4/4/85, 9.4m, hole at 34m depth. Level rose to 4.4m in eleven days to 15/4/85. Depth to water at end of shift 15/4/85, 5.2m, level rose to 4.5m overnight. Depth to water on completion 7.3m. Standpipe piezometer installed at 35.3m in sand filter with bentonite seal above. Hole grouted from 34m to 30.2m. Bentonite seal to 29.7m. Standpipe piezometer installed at 29.2m in sand filter, bentonite seal above. Hole grouted from 28.2m to 11m and then backfilled to 1m depth. Cover placed in concrete plug at surface.",""
"DATA","13738981","7.85","","4.5","Depth to water at end of shift 5m, hole at 10m. Level rose to 4.5m overnight. Depth to water on completion, casing removed, 4.5m.",""
"DATA","13738983","8.75","","5","Depth to water on completion 5m, casing removed",""
"DATA","13738984","9.40","","6.3","Hole dry on completion. Depth to water after removing casing 6.3m. Borehole grouted from 25m to 13m.",""
"DATA","13738986","8.50","","11","Borehole dry at end of shift, hole at 22.45m. Water rose to 5.5m overnight. Borehole rotary cored from 36m to 36.1m. Depth to water on completion 11m. Borehole backfilled from 50m to 44m. Standpipe piezometer installed at 44m within sand response zone with 0.5m bentonite seal above. Borehole grouted from 43m to 14m and then backfilled to within one metre of ground level. Cover placed in concrete plug at surface.",""
"DATA","13738988","3.80","","2.1","",""
"DATA","13738988","7.60","","2.1","Depth to water at end of shift 6.1m, rose to 4.2m overnight. Borehole dry on completion of shift and remained dry overnight.",""
"DATA","13738988","27.20","","2.1","Depth to water on completion of boring 2.1m. Pneumatic piezometer installed at 19.6m with deep sand filter and 0.5m bentonite seals above and below filter zone. Hole grouted up from 35m to 20.5m and 18.5m to 9m. Vandal proof cover installed at surface in concrete plug.",""
"DATA","13738989","6.90","","3.9","Overnight level rose to 3.9m. Baled dry at start of next day.",""
"DATA","13738989","24.70","","3.9","Depth to water after weekend was 3.9m. Standpipe piezometer installed at 7.5m with 1m deep pea gravel filter and with 1m bentonite seals above and below filter zone. Hole grouted up from 35m to 9m and from 6m to surface. Cover installed at surface in concrete plug.",""
"DATA","13738991","3.30","","5.3","Depth to water at end of shift 3.3m, level rose to 1.8m overnight hole at 3.5m.",""
"DATA","13738991","9.10","","5.3","Depth to water at end of shift 4.7m, level rose to 4.1m over weekend, hole at 10.3m. Borehole dry at end of shift at 22m, and remained dry overnight.",""
"DATA","13738991","26.90","","5.3","Depth to water at end of shift 11.3m, hole at 26.9m, level rose to 10.1m overnight, hole at 36.1m. Depth to water at end of shift 12.2m, level rose to 4.2m overnight, hole at 36.45m. Depth to water remained around 4.2m whilst chiselling through rock. Depth to water at end of shift when hole at 37.5m, 4.6m, level rose to 3.8m overnight. Depth to water at end of shift when hole at 42.9m, 6.9m, level rose to 5.8m. Depth to water on completion, 5.3m. Borehole filled with gravel from 50m. Standpipe piezometer installed at 46.2m within gravel filter zone with 1m bentonite seal above. Borehole grouted to 10.5m depth and backfilled to within one metre of ground level. Cover placed in concrete plug at surface.",""
"DATA","13738993","9.00","","25","Depth to water at end of shift 20m, hole at 33.3m. Level rose to 18m overnight. Depth to water on completion 25m. Standpipe piezometer placed at 35.2m in 0.5m sand filter with bentonite seal above. Borehole grouted from 34m to 31m. Standpipe piezometer placed at 29.7m in 1m sand filter with bentonite seals above and below. Hole grouted from 20m to 10m and then backfilled to within 1m of surface. Cover placed in concrete plug at ground level.",""
"DATA","13738993","27.00","","25","Depth to water at end of shift 20m, hole at 33.3m. Level rose to 18m overnight. Depth to water on completion 25m. Standpipe piezometer placed at 35.2m in 0.5m sand filter with bentonite seal above. Borehole grouted from 34m to 31m. Standpipe piezometer placed at 29.7m in 1m sand filter with bentonite seals above and below. Hole grouted from 20m to 10m and then backfilled to within 1m of surface. Cover placed in concrete plug at ground level.",""
"DATA","13738995","2.90","","7.7","Depth to water at end of shift 10.2m, hole at 27m. Depth to water on completion, 7.7m. Standpipe piezometer installed at 27.2m depth in sand filter with 0.6m bentonite seal above to 26m. Hole grouted up to 11.5m, then 0.5m bentonite seal to 11m. Standpipe installed from 9.5m, bottom 1.8m slotted in pea gravel filter from 11m to 9.2m, then 0.5m bentonite seal, and backfilled to within 1m of surface. Cover placed in concrete plug at surface.",""
"DATA","13738995","9.20","","7.7","Depth to water at end of shift 10.2m, hole at 27m. Depth to water on completion, 7.7m. Standpipe piezometer installed at 27.2m depth in sand filter with 0.6m bentonite seal above to 26m. Hole grouted up to 11.5m, then 0.5m bentonite seal to 11m. Standpipe installed from 9.5m, bottom 1.8m slotted in pea gravel filter from 11m to 9.2m, then 0.5m bentonite seal, and backfilled to within 1m of surface. Cover placed in concrete plug at surface.",""
"DATA","13738995","26.10","","7.7","Depth to water at end of shift 10.2m, hole at 27m. Depth to water on completion, 7.7m. Standpipe piezometer installed at 27.2m depth in sand filter with 0.6m bentonite seal above to 26m. Hole grouted up to 11.5m, then 0.5m bentonite seal to 11m. Standpipe installed from 9.5m, bottom 1.8m slotted in pea gravel filter from 11m to 9.2m, then 0.5m bentonite seal, and backfilled to within 1m of surface. Cover placed in concrete plug at surface.",""

